{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[{"kind":"hero","estimatedTimeInMinutes":10,"backgroundImage":"ic_unified_ds.png","projectFiles":"OUDS-Discovery-Tutorial.zip","chapter":"Import of the Swift Package and choose its librairies","title":"Swift Package integration","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS iOS is exposed through an open source Swift Package hosted on GitHub, and provides several librairies for your needs."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"These librairies help to split products and make users able to select only what they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI is the only official supported framework for Apple platforms."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"xcodeRequirement":"Xcode 26.5","image":"ic_unified_ds.png"},{"kind":"tasks","tasks":[{"stepsSection":[{"type":"step","code":null,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Using Xcode, in your ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"project package dependencies"}]},{"text":", add a new ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"dependency"}]},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Search with the GitHub repository URL (https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios), and select the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"ouds-ios","type":"text"}]},{"text":" dependency.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You can then choose the ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"dependency rule","type":"text"}]},{"text":" you want.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"To know which version you need, you can have a look on the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki\/01-%E2%80%90-Available-API"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and also the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/releases"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Let’s say you will use some beta version today, e.g. the version 3.0.0-beta.8","type":"text"}]}],"caption":[],"media":"tutorial-discovery-1-ouds-swift-package.png","runtimePreview":null},{"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once you downloaded the package, you will see several librairies are available."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"They can be embeded inside your "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"target","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" librairies."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Things are separated to let users integrate only what they need and embed the abre minimum of content."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSThemesContract","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" library provides the main elements like the ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The theme contract is defined inside it.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSThemesOrange","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" provides the theme implementation for the Orange products, and contains also assets and all tokens for this theme.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSThemesSosh","type":"text"}]},{"text":" provides the theme implementation for the Sosh products, and contains also assets and all tokens for this theme.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSThemesWireframe"}]},{"text":" provides the theme implementation for the Wireframe theme, which is a theme dedicated to mockups and prototypes.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSThemesOrangeCompact"}]},{"type":"text","text":" provides the theme implementation for the Orange products but with constraints of sizes and spaces."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSComponents","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" contains the SwiftUI OUDS components defined with the Figma specifications, and also useful view modifers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSTokensRaw","type":"text"}]},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSTokensSemantic","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSTokensComponents"}]},{"type":"text","text":" are librairies defining and providing the tokens for low level (raw),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"middle level (semantic) or component levels (high level)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSModules"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is for modules or rich components with extra logic."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSFoundations","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is dedicated to some utilities and shared logic."}]}],"code":null,"media":"tutorial-discovery-1-ouds-libraries.png","runtimePreview":null,"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add for example only the umbrella product merging all products mentioned above: "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSSwiftUI"}]}]}]}],"anchor":"Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries","title":"Import the Swift Package and the libraries","contentSection":[{"mediaPosition":"trailing","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS for iOS is an open source Swift Package available on GitHub under MIT license.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The package and the librairies must be added through Xcode.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"contentAndMedia"}]}]},{"assessments":[{"choices":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"I can contribute to OUDS using pull request"}]}],"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS is open source, under MIT license, and hosted on GitHub. Of course you can contribute!"}]}],"isCorrect":true},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS supports officialy all Apple OS like visionOS, tvOS, watchOS, iPadOS, iOS and also CarPlay."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The main supported targets are iOS \/ iPadOS. However we do our best to support macOS, visionOS, tvOS and watchOS."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"CarPlay specific cases are not scoped yet."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"isCorrect":false},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS provides UIKit components"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS supports only SwiftUI."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"isCorrect":false}],"type":"multiple-choice","content":[],"title":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Which of these choices is correct?","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"multiple-choice","title":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Which imports of the OUDS Swift Package products can I choose?"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"content":[],"choices":[{"isCorrect":true,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some of the available products depending to my needs, or only "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSSwiftUI"},{"type":"text","text":" if I am very lazy and don’t care about my app size."}]}],"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can import all products provided by the Swift Package, and tailor your choice to keep only the ones needed.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Even if we recommend to choose only the atomic products you need, the ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSSwiftUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" product wraps all of them."}]}]},{"isCorrect":false,"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You need to chose the products the Swift package provides.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"None, only the Swift package dependency matter."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"anchor":"Check-Your-Understanding","kind":"assessments"},{"action":{"overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get started"}],"isActive":true,"overridingTitle":"Get started","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme","type":"reference"},"title":"Instanciate and inject a theme","abstract":[{"text":"The theme is exposed as one object which will be injected inside your SwiftUI view.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The theme provides all tokens which defines in the end the rendering of everything.","type":"text"}],"kind":"callToAction","featuredEyebrow":"Tutorial"}],"hierarchy":{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","modules":[{"projects":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies","sections":[{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies#Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries"},{"kind":"assessment","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies#Check-Your-Understanding"}]}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Import-of-the-Swift-Package-and-choose-its-librairies"},{"projects":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme","sections":[{"referenc